   "say": "With Russian, Greek and Turkish.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "say": "Almost twice as long as Spanish.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "say": "So if you grew up with Hebrew, you already speak a hard language."
  },
  {
   "say": "English? You've done harder."
  },
  {
   "say": "So the next time someone says English is too hard for you, ask them:"
  }
